&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in application security, with strong hands-on experience across both mobile and backend systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
