&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Practical coding experience, preferably in Ruby, Go, Python&amp;nbsp; languages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to clearly communicate security risks, tradeoffs, and remediation guidance to engineering partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
